#: src/languages/sml.md:3
msgid "Standard ML"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:5
msgid ""
"Standard ML support is available through the community-maintained [Standard "
"ML extension](https://github.com/omarjatoi/zed-sml)."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:7
msgid ""
"Tree-sitter: [MatthewFluet/tree-sitter-sml](https://github.com/MatthewFluet/"
"tree-sitter-sml)"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:8
msgid "Language Server: [Millet](https://github.com/azdavis/millet)"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:10
msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:12
msgid ""
"Install a Standard ML implementation such as [SML/NJ](https://www.smlnj."
"org/) or [MLton](http://mlton.org/) to compile and run your code."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:13
msgid ""
"[Install Millet](https://github.com/azdavis/millet#install) and ensure "
"`millet-ls` is on your `$PATH`."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:15
msgid "Project setup"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:17
msgid ""
"For projects with more than one source file, Millet expects a single root "
"group file. Create a `millet.toml` in the directory you open in Zed:"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:19
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"version = 1\n"
"[workspace]\n"
"root = \"sources.mlb\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/sml.md:25
msgid ""
"The root must be either a [ML Basis (MLB)](http://mlton.org/MLBasis) file (`."
"mlb`, used with MLton) or a [SML/NJ Compilation Manager (CM)](https://www."
"smlnj.org/doc/CM/new.pdf) file (`.cm`, used with SML/NJ). Files not "
"transitively reachable from the root are not analyzed. See the [Millet "
"manual](https://github.com/azdavis/millet/blob/main/docs/manual.md) for more "
"options."
msgstr ""
